                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN ZUR SIGNALISIERUNG EINES IDENTIFIKATORS EINES ÖFFENTLICHEN LANDFUNKNETZES ÜBER EIN GEMEINSAM GENUTZTES FUNKFREQUENZSPEKTRUMSBAND</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">TECHNIQUES DE SIGNALISATION D'UN IDENTIFIANT DE RÉSEAU MOBILE TERRESTRE PUBLIC SUR UNE BANDE DE SPECTRE RADIOFRÉQUENCE PARTAGÉE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">TECHNIQUES FOR SIGNALING A PUBLIC LAND MOBILE NETWORK IDENTIFIER OVER A SHARED RADIO FREQUENCY SPECTRUM BAND</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for wireless communication at a user equipment, UE (115), and a respective apparatus are described. The method comprising receiving (1805) an instance of a discovery reference signal, DRS, on a beam over a shared radio frequency spectrum band, determining (1810) a public land mobile network identifier, PLMN ID, based at least in part on a time-frequency location of the instance of the DRS and selectively performing (1815) a random access procedure based at least in part on the determined PLMN ID.</p>
            </abstract>
